Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:11.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, Ioryogi! What a cute kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.77,0:00:16.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I need a home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.04,0:00:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.45,0:00:20.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need to keep wasting your time on crap like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so fluffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.93,0:00:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What did I just tell you!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.79,0:00:27.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't let a kitten go lonely!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So what are you gonna do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.28,0:00:33.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.26,0:00:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This way the kitty won't be lonely and I can still look for people to heal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.71,0:00:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to be stuck here your whole life?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.69,0:02:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't even take care of yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.95,0:02:19.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and you want to look after a kitten? Don't make me laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't just ignore her!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.61,0:02:30.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What, a stray cat this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.74,0:02:34.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wrong! Its owner just couldn't care for it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.69,0:02:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's the same thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.17,0:02:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't even start if you're not ready to commit to taking care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.60,0:02:44.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're so mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.69,0:02:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's right, though, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.53,0:02:50.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kitty?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.81,0:02:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's probably hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.81,0:03:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the answer to number 5, Chiho?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.90,0:03:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't get it either, Chise?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.17,0:03:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.35,0:03:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.06,0:03:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.94,0:03:20.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I need food!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.25,0:03:28.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mama went out for a while, this is all we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:32.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe something a little more than a snack...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.81,0:03:35.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.75,0:03:38.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's for this kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.57,0:03:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, it's cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.16,0:03:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Its owner can't take care of it anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.11,0:03:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So i thought maybe you could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.19,0:03:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can we go to your room, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.10,0:03:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.51,0:04:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's enjoying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.62,0:04:02.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:07.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you two being so quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.91,0:04:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mama doesn't allow pets here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One of the tenants before had a dog, and the neighbors complained about its barking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.02,0:04:26.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So she isn't taking new tenants with pets anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.63,0:04:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you can't really take care of it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.69,0:04:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why not go back to the owner?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.09,0:04:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.72,0:04:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I found her in a box.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It didn't have the owner's name on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.68,0:04:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see. But you can't keep it here. {lit. at this rate it'd have to go aline}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.71,0:04:51.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope you can find someone to take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.14,0:04:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll ask Miss Sayaka tomorrow at Yomogi Nursery!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.93,0:05:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure Sayaka would agree!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.70,0:05:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And if it's at Yomogi we can go see her anytime!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.12,0:05:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should probably give her a name, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.00,0:05:09.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.71,0:05:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.77,0:05:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's too sudden! I can't think of anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's white all over, so maybe Milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.45,0:05:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Plus, she loves drinking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.81,0:05:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Milk, huh? That's a cute name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.00,0:05:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:37.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so white and cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.73,0:05:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's called Milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.94,0:05:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, Milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to hold her too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.57,0:05:45.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.89,0:05:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me feel her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.68,0:05:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone's having so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So can we keep her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:05:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come over here, Yuzuru.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.59,0:06:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuzuru, are you allergic to cats?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.72,0:06:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Allergic to cats?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.30,0:06:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,People who are sneeze and their skin breaks out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If it's really bad, it can even trigger asthma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.10,0:06:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.39,0:06:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We can't keep cats here at Yomogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.59,0:06:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.88,0:06:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.15,0:06:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When you just up and do things like that, it makes trouble for everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.10,0:06:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It wasn't just a whim!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.13,0:06:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why not take care of it yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.60,0:06:37.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.99,0:06:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you're just going to take things halfway so you can be self-satisfied,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.72,0:06:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,you're as bad as the guy who abandoned her to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.88,0:06:49.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.25,0:06:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm feeling better now, so{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.06,0:06:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.57,0:07:07.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quit playing with me! Just because I'm a stuffed animal doesn't mean that's all I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.54,0:07:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, there you are, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.68,0:07:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.01,0:07:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mind if I sit next to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.89,0:07:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.71,0:07:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to get you down like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.97,0:07:28.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.43,0:07:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto wasn't trying to be mean either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.46,0:07:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think... That kitten kind of reminded him of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.22,0:07:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I'll look for someone who can take care of it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.67,0:07:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be okay. I'm sure we'll find someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.94,0:07:49.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.14,0:07:53.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So what are you going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.03,0:07:56.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll look for someone who'll take care of Milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.10,0:07:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That way I won't cause any trouble for everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I agree. It'll make my life easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.18,0:08:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.10,0:08:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.15,0:08:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.34,0:08:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is Milk here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A cat allergy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.34,0:08:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.93,0:08:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe we should ask Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.24,0:08:28.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We can't, pets aren't allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.97,0:08:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we do, she'll really be in a tough spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.47,0:08:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.48,0:08:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Won't someone take this kitty in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.20,0:08:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, take care of this kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, help this kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:47.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Chiho, Chise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.33,0:08:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, Milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.23,0:08:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you been a good girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.95,0:08:59.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, I asked Miss Sayaka, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.53,0:09:01.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We heard about it from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.12,0:09:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not your fault, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I can't find anyone else to take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.27,0:09:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll help out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.46,0:09:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure we'll find a new owner for Milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.09,0:09:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I have my hands full with just the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.27,0:09:28.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong, Catharine?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.89,0:09:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.55,0:09:39.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Another one of you annoying salesmen!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.94,0:09:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.97,0:09:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.56,0:09:49.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.00,0:09:51.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.19,0:10:10.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, Milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.71,0:10:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, that's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.19,0:10:18.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you're looking for someone to take care of her...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.53,0:10:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.77,0:10:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pretty much everyone I know lives alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.46,0:10:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know how fast I'll be, but I'll help out too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.10,0:10:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to bother you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not bothered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.67,0:10:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After all, you're so serious about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.61,0:10:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It makes everyone want to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.98,0:10:39.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.55,0:10:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But maybe we should stop knocking on strangers' doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But Fujimoto said that if I do things halfway just to be self-satisfied,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.33,0:10:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just like the person who abandoned her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.29,0:10:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's Kiyokazu for you. You shouldn't let him get to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.77,0:11:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think there's anyone who'd want to get rid of a cute kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.56,0:11:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure there must have been a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.41,0:11:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto seemed so lonely then...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.10,0:11:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's just like he said. I can't take it halfway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got to do all I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.12,0:11:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This time I'll ask everyone I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.52,0:11:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you have any trouble, just give me a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure. Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.38,0:11:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like they're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.94,0:11:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.14,0:12:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm busy with the cooking, I don't have time for a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.02,0:12:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.30,0:12:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I couldn't help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.10,0:12:18.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, Mihara residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.62,0:12:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A kitten?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.54,0:12:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to keep it here, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.00,0:12:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That happened with the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.77,0:12:33.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I understand. Talk to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.77,0:12:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.37,0:12:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's getting pretty dark, isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Milk's getting tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.61,0:12:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.72,0:13:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She must be hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.26,0:13:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.83,0:13:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.69,0:13:13.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so worthless. I can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't even buy cat food!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.47,0:13:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Chise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.95,0:13:25.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.17,0:13:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We really should ask Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.90,0:13:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I'm sure she'd let us get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.74,0:13:34.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then we can sleep with Milk tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.44,0:13:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should sleep over too, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.89,0:13:38.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.49,0:13:40.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's that{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.66,0:13:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the young lady who sang so beautifully.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.25,0:13:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know her, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.19,0:13:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.41,0:13:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How's the baby doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.84,0:13:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,His mommy had the day off, so she's spending it with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.95,0:13:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.46,0:14:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.89,0:14:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I heard there was a girl looking for a home for her kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.57,0:14:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.62,0:14:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It must be this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.27,0:14:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's so tiny and cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.18,0:14:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can take care of her if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.57,0:14:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really!?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.02,0:14:25.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. My grandson is an only child, so he'll have someone to play with.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.42,0:14:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.01,0:14:33.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's people who sneeze and break out when they touch a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.94,0:14:36.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Will a baby be okay around her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.59,0:14:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The pizza boy from before was worried about the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.81,0:14:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The pizza boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.23,0:14:48.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. He was insisting the person he delivered to take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.31,0:14:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I overheard him while passing by, and that's why I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.28,0:14:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was Fujimoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.24,0:14:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My grandson loves animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.90,0:15:02.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He won't have any problem with allergies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.96,0:15:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's great, Milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.87,0:15:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You won't be alone anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.80,0:15:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.01,0:15:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye, Milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.68,0:15:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll come see you sometime!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.77,0:15:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.50,0:15:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Milk's dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.96,0:15:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.55,0:15:31.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take good care of her, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.66,0:15:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.57,0:15:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It feels so empty in here without Milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.25,0:15:52.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I feel refreshed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.41,0:15:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's Milk's milk dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.82,0:16:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Chiho and Chise must feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.22,0:16:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.37,0:16:14.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.43,0:16:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.54,0:16:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.40,0:16:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The twins are up on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.54,0:16:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She must be treating Milk well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.22,0:16:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She seemed so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.00,0:16:37.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure they'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.50,0:16:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.96,0:16:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.88,0:16:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I forgot to bring it back earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.04,0:16:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Milk's{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.75,0:16:48.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Milk dish...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.44,0:16:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now that I think of it, it was a full moon when I first met her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.39,0:17:02.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The cherry blossoms were so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.82,0:17:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She had gone for a walk with a baby, and he wouldn't stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:14.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I tried to heal him, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.38,0:17:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He just kept crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.30,0:17:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.10,0:17:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.93,0:17:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then I sang a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.69,0:17:28.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You sing, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.64,0:17:29.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.91,0:17:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When I did, he stopped crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of song was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.58,0:17:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.56,0:17:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.25,0:17:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let us hear it, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.03,0:17:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.49,0:17:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.05,0:18:07.67,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,The flowers which blossom in spring
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.70,0:18:14.19,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Are plucked in the summer sun
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.20,0:18:20.83,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Within my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.77,0:18:27.32,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Their shine remains
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.34,0:18:34.07,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even on days I close my windows
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.86,0:18:40.50,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,To shut out the morning rain
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.37,0:18:47.37,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Fluttering within my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.98,0:18:53.76,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,The light breaks through the clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.57,0:19:08.23,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,A faraway voice leads me on
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.68,0:19:15.14,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Like it's smiling, like it's singing
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.54,0:19:21.44,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,The echoing sound of the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.76,0:19:27.82,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Joy and sadness
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.27,0:19:34.22,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I embrace them both and keep going
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.89,0:19:41.43,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,My hand and yours
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.71,0:19:47.52,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Join together strongly
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.03,0:20:24.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.56,0:20:27.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for doing that for Milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.33,0:20:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She found a great new owner because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that all you needed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.60,0:20:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.07,0:20:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.00,0:20:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I just remembered something important!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.80,0:20:51.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I borrow your phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.81,0:20:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, give me a call if you find a cat-lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.24,0:20:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.85,0:21:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.32,0:21:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.47,0:21:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Umm... Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.26,0:21:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.31,0:21:16.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The kitty found a new owner!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.66,0:21:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I just wanted to let you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.71,0:21:19.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.61,0:21:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto found her one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.07,0:21:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.34,0:21:27.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.75,0:21:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to bother you with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.39,0:21:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's great, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.01,0:21:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.47,0:21:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.07,0:21:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.92,0:21:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto's the one who found Milk a new owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.04,0:21:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.95,0:21:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You did nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.42,0:21:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,except drag a kitten around and bother everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.95,0:22:05.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... Everyone worried so much because of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.11,0:22:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But there's a give-and-take.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.54,0:22:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just like everything in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.93,0:22:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When you let her go, you realized Chiho and Chise's loneliness,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.81,0:22:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and sang for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.98,0:22:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was just trying to tell them about the baby and his grandmother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.62,0:22:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was enough to cheer them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.94,0:22:30.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Songs can heal people's hearts, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.53,0:22:32.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.03,0:22:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They won't heal my scarred ear!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.41,0:22:37.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So zero points for you, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.35,0:22:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But... It's round, just like the moon tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.38,0:22:46.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get so happy about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.40,0:22:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, and Milk's dish was round too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.63,0:22:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They all match!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.20,0:22:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, if you like round things so much, I'll be sure to give you plenty more zeroes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.16,0:22:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're so mean, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.28,0:00:54.15,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{95 after the first frame of ribbon}What shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.15,0:01:02.45,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.45,0:01:12.25,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:18.05,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.05,0:01:25.81,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.81,0:01:31.48,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:36.70,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.70,0:01:42.99,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.99,0:01:48.67,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.67,0:01:55.38,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.38,0:02:04.10,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.77,0:02:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,1125)\pos(424,166)}... A kitten's lullabye.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.94,0:23:08.11,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{14 into ED}People all want to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.78,0:23:15.62,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but they're cheated by gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.20,0:23:23.63,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,everyone can really fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.21,0:23:32.26,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,She must be so unhappy because
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.59,0:23:43.27,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,she forgot her own shadow somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.65,0:23:45.98,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.52,0:23:54.41,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,If you tell me "thanks", if you say "thanks" and smile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.41,0:24:01.50,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Going back and forth, we'll be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.29,0:24:11.01,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be happy, there'll be nothing to worry about
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.09,0:24:15.18,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as we're together
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.89,0:24:28.32,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It's strange, I'm crying even though I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.31,0:24:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(540,388)}... Summer memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.31,0:24:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(538,116)}Next episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.34,0:23:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
